    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῠάχετος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], ὁ</span>, 
